	(text "CD audio out (rev 0.4, docs/pcb-rev04.md item 6): PWM on GP44 and GP45 (slice 10 A and B),\neach through two RC stages (1k, 10 nF: about 16 kHz) and a 10 uF DC block, to a 4-pin header\nin CD-ROM drives' order for the sound card's CD input. No PIO needed."
